         "children": [
          {
           "t": "heading",
           "level": "h2",
           "text": "What Do Austin Logo Designers at Logo Austin Do?",
           "classes": []
          },
          {
           "t": "text",
           "html": "<p><strong>Logo Austin's logo designers</strong> turn a business name and a rough idea into a finished, professional logo. Every logo is drawn from scratch in Adobe Illustrator rather than assembled from templates, so the result is original to your business and can be scaled from a business card to a billboard.</p><p>The team works with brand-new businesses that need a first logo, established companies that want a refresh, and owners who need an existing logo cleaned up or converted to vector format.</p>",
           "classes": []
          }
         ]
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    }
