         "children": [
          {
           "t": "heading",
           "level": "h2",
           "text": "How the Logo Design Process Works",
           "classes": []
          },
          {
           "t": "text",
           "html": "<p>A typical Logo Austin project moves from first call to final files in about a day.</p><ol><li><strong>Research and discovery.</strong> You share your business name, slogan, industry, target customers and any colors or logos you like. Designers review competitors in your field.</li><li><strong>Concept development.</strong> Designers sketch and build several distinct logo concepts, usually delivered by text or email within a few hours.</li><li><strong>Feedback and revisions.</strong> You pick a favorite and request changes to fonts, colors, icons or layout. Revisions continue until the logo is right.</li><li><strong>Final files.</strong> After you approve and pay, you receive the complete file set in JPG, PNG, PDF, SVG, AI and EPS formats with full ownership.</li></ol>",
           "classes": []
          }
         ]
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
